     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,51,102)\">Colleagues:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,51,102)\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,51,102)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,51,102)\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,51,102)\">    Please distribute the contents of this email regarding this year’s <span>Stats</span> <span>Camp</span>. </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,51,102)\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,51,102)\"><span>Stats</span> <span>Camp</span> is coming! The 1<sup>st</sup> week of courses begins June 5-9 followed by week 2 June 12-16.  This year, we will be in Albuquerque, New Mexico with 16 different course offerings (including <b>Bayesian <span>SEM</span></b>) and all courses include <i><u>one-on-one consultations</u></i><u>.</u> You can visit <a href=\"http://www.statscamp.org/\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.statscamp.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792463644057000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2lbxFVrLciQhNgrTVa6fiP\">www.statscamp.org</a> for more information and to register. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,51,102)\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,51,102)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,51,102)\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,51,102)\">Courses:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,51,102)\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,51,102)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,51,102)\"></span></p><ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Bayesian <span>SEM</span></span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span>SEM</span> Foundations</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Social Network Analysis</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Latent Class Analysis</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Multilevel Modeling</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Bayesian Data Analysis</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">PLS Path Modeling Using ADANCO, SmartPLS, and R</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Psychometrics</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Program Evaluation</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Statistical Programming and Data Analysis with R</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Mediation and Moderation</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\"><span>SEM</span> with Mplus</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Longitudinal Mixture Modeling</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Longitudinal <span>SEM</span></span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Meta-Analysis</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0.0001pt 15px;color:rgb(0,51,102);background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Multilevel <span>SEM</span> with xxM</span></li></ol><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,51,102)\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif;color:rgb(0,51,102)\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,51,102)\">    Thank you!</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,51,102)\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,51,102)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,51,102)\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;color:rgb(0,51,102)\">         -Todd Little and the <span>stats</span> <span>camp</span> team​</span></p></div>"
